# Product Images Directory
# Place your product images here with the following filenames:

# 1. cresta-pack.png - Cresta Table Water (Pack)
# 2. imperial-pack.png - Imperial Table Water (Pack)  
# 3. cresta-single.png - Cresta Table Water (Single Bottle)
# 4. imperial-single.png - Imperial Table Water (Single Bottle)
# 5. sachet-water.png - Greshalom Pure Water (Sachet)

# Recommended specifications:
# - Format: PNG (preferred for transparency) or JPG
# - Dimensions: 400x400px or 800x800px (2x for retina)
# - Background: White or transparent
# - Images will fill entire card width (object-cover)
# - Style: Clean, professional product photography
# - Consistent lighting and angles across all products